WEBVTT

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:42.740
<b>21:                Miracle</b>

00:01:43.280 --> 00:02:01.680
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:46.570
<i>Damn.</i>

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:48.950
<i>I should be looking for Hou-nee.</i>

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:52.630
<i>I don't have time to save them right now.</i>

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:55.390
<i>Why am I hesitating?</i>

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.730
<i>This is war.</i>

00:01:57.730 --> 00:01:59.900
<i>It's obvious there'd be casualties.</i>

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:06.470
She's one tough girl.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.450
Of course.

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:13.770
She has the strong body and soul 
of a Zenshin practitioner.

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.990
Beating her won't be easy.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.680
<i>I'll pretend I didn't see them.</i>

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:23.810
<i>I may be overwhelmed by guilt later,</i>

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:27.430
<i>but I'm sure I'll get over it in time.</i>

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:32.730
<i>I should go.</i>

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.620
You're a real high-maintenance girl.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:46.500
Are you Chou Soran?

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:50.030
Get him!

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:51.390
You're not getting away!

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:54.200
<i>Damn it! What am I doing?</i>

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:08.250
Come!

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.630
Soran, how dare you?!

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.840
Are there other enemies around?

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.530
Tell me what's going on. Quickly.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.030
That's all of them.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:36.600
I ran into them when I cornered that woman.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.170
Anyway...

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:39.350
Shh.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:42.320
Why did you abandon Hana-chan?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.540
Listen to me.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:49.190
It's hard to save both of you 
simultaneously given the circumstances.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.200
That fatty is stronger than he looks.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:56.300
I wasn't expecting him to dodge my Raihou.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:04:01.380
The moment I failed to take him out, 
I had to change my plan.

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:04.720
Tsuu Kinka can't fight anymore.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.970
It was better to save you first.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:09.970
That's the decision I made.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:14.520
You think you can get away from us?

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.930
Calm down.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:23.350
Look, you guys have four choices.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:27.440
One: fight us.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.780
Two: leave without doing anything.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:34.230
Three: take her with you and leave.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:38.070
Four: kill her and leave.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.660
What are you saying?!

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:44.140
Let go! You're stretching my shirt!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.380
I like this shirt!

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.310
Like I care!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:50.280
I just told them what their options are.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:54.190
They should start to consider
the pros and cons of each.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:54.880
Huh?

00:04:55.580 --> 00:05:01.330
If we're willing to risk our lives, 
we may be able to beat all of them.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:05.550
But it's also possible 
we'll be killed instead.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:09.520
I'd like to avoid a head-on fight.

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.450
I'm sure they would, too.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.780
Impertinent brat.

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:19.530
Hey. Take the woman and go.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:22.600
We'll slow them down.

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:27.590
What will you do now, Chou Soran?

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:31.440
I thought I told you.

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:36.130
You have only four options!

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:42.340
Do you get it now?

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:46.990
My White Nagamushi allows 
me to make ranged attacks

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.210
on someone once I have their blood.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:54.070
<i>He got some of Hana-chan's blood 
during the earlier skirmish.</i>

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.670
You're free to do what you want with her,

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:00.000
but if you try to take her with you,

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.220
you'll get caught in the crossfire 
of my White Nagamushi.

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:07.730
If you're still determined 
to take her, be my guest.

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:15.100
I said you have four options, 
but you actually only have two.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:18.680
Leave her or kill her.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:23.010
Just so you know, if you 
choose the latter...

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.290
I'll kill you or die trying.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.520
Hey! Where are you going?

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:32.070
We're leaving.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:35.830
She's not worth that much.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.920
He's willing to let us go.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.910
We'll accept his offer.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:44.310
Damn it! But we finally caught one of them!

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:48.290
You just want the woman.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:53.800
If you're willing to die 
for her, I won't stop you.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.760
Damn it!

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:03.130
Hana-chan!

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.250
Hang in there.

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:09.950
Couldn't you have come 
up with a better plan?

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:13.680
I couldn't think of anything else.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:17.980
They're true fiends.

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:22.460
They weren't even bothered 
by one of their allies dying.

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:26.390
Compared to that, what I did was nothing.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.250
<i>They leave.</i>

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:32.020
<i>When people die, they leave this world.</i>

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:36.740
<i>I never questioned my existence.</i>

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:39.860
<i>I took life for granted.</i>

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.290
<i>I even though it was boring.</i>

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:47.490
<i>So I longed for something 
special—a miracle.</i>

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:53.690
<i>But when I came face to face 
with it, I realized something.</i>

00:07:54.480 --> 00:08:00.080
<i>What I always wanted was something 
too insignificant to describe.</i>

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:05.660
<i>And when it disappeared, I lost everything.</i>

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:11.140
<i>For the first time, I felt alive.</i>

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.690
<i>Living itself was the miracle.</i>

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:18.040
<i>As long as you're alive, 
you have infinite possibilities.</i>

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:22.440
<i>But the moment this miracle ends,</i>

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:25.940
<i>those possibilities and 
everything else disappear.</i>

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:27.550
<i>They're gone.</i>

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:33.590
Soran?

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:38.180
Uh, I wasn't trying to blame you.

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:40.950
I'm really grateful you saved us.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.140
This place is dangerous.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.660
We should find the others.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.070
Follow me!

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:48.710
Huh?

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.650
Hey, wait!

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:54.770
<i>Hou-nee, please be okay.</i>

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:10.940
Wow.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:15.010
I stopped sensing his 
breath the moment he hid.

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.650
I've never fought anyone like this.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:19.120
Miss.

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:23.000
I know you're dying to 
get back to Chou Soran,

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.270
but you shouldn't distract 
yourself right now.

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:31.070
Baron has an advantage in the forest.

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:33.800
He's a professional fighter.

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:37.680
Getting distracted will 
put you at a disadvantage.

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:42.050
Focus on defeating your opponent.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.100
Okay...

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:49.300
<i>That old geezer... He's helping the enemy.</i>

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:52.590
<i>She stopped bleeding?</i>

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:55.240
<i>The cut is already starting to close.</i>

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:57.810
<i>What a strange girl.</i>

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:02.320
<i>It's like that warrior said.</i>

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:06.870
What I just showed you was 
a certain person's memory.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:11.110
The appearance of the girl in it, Fuu Houhou,

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:14.590
hasn't changed a bit in over ten years.

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:18.630
What do you think, Old Man 
Ryuusei and Baron-san?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.650
Interesting, isn't it?

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:24.250
It's certainly mysterious.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:30.390
What is this girl's connection
to the Koushin War?

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:34.000
The memory I showed you belonged to

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:38.020
the central figure of the 
Koushin War, Chou Kaigi.

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:42.980
What? That girl killed Chou Kaigi?

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:52.690
But if she killed Chou Kaigi, 
I'm not sure we can handle her.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:56.410
I'm sure the Express Delivery 
Company will be there, too.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.230
Don't worry.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:03.140
We'll have the others attack 
Ryuukosan and distract them.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:08.590
I want the two of you to bring me 
Fuu Houhou. Understand?

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:28.230
<i>Despite suffering what was 
clearly a grave wound,</i>

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.880
<i>her strange body has healed 
in a short amount of time.</i>

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.620
<i>It's like that warrior said.</i>

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:38.420
<i>Its mystery is truly intriguing.</i>

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:43.310
<i>But there's something else I must confirm.</i>

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:48.690
<i>What is he planning?</i>

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.270
What did you do?

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:13.550
It was too quick. I couldn't see anything.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:17.900
<i>I struck her vagus nerve.</i>

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:24.130
<i>In this country's terms, 
I struck her Dachangjing.</i>

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.960
<i>She's still conscious.</i>

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:37.950
<i>I knew I felt something.</i>

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.170
<i>I was right.</i>

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.340
Are you finished?

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:46.060
Yeah. Do what you want with her.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:53.900
She's still full of energy.

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:06.810
You were struggling so much earlier.

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:09.740
That was easy.

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.710
I'm interested in two things:

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:18.100
the unknown and the threat 
hidden in the unknown.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:22.750
This girl attracted my interest.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:27.710
But I didn't detect any animosity in her.

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:31.950
You know I was a soldier.

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:37.590
In war, eliminating the 
enemy is the top priority.

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:42.920
Being able to instantaneously determine

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:47.900
if someone is an enemy is an essential skill.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:53.150
Even if a lapse in judgment 
results in a fatal error,

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:56.990
you must never stop judging 
a person's hostility.

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:02.840
Once you cross that line, 
you become a murderer.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:07.020
Eventually you become a butcher.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:11.130
I detected no hostility in her.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.940
She's not a threat to me.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:17.040
I can't see her as an enemy.

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:22.510
Wait, wait. Aren't soldiers 
supposed to follow orders?

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:26.630
I'm not one of you yet.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:32.100
I came to Ryuukosan to understand Zensei.

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:37.270
The Koushin War is certainly interesting.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:43.860
I would've joined you if you were 
seeking the truth behind it.

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:47.540
But you go too far.

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:51.630
I should be thanking you, though.

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:54.880
Because of you, I met someone interesting.

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:58.200
Unbelievable.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.720
I knew we couldn't count on an outsider.

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:12.140
She's a cockroach.

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:14.580
You're not going after her?

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:18.720
Maybe it's my imagination...

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:26.390
but since we met her, 
you've seemed rather happy.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.860
Something about her feels nostalgic.

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:35.910
Looking at her reminds me of the past.

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:40.400
I'll drop off the whiskey later.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.290
I lost the bet.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:48.110
That cockroach was definitely 
born with that strength.

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.890
How are you guys doing?

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.680
They got 70-80% of us.

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:03.930
Most everyone else ran.

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:07.290
Did you get the Tsuutenroku?

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:09.050
We failed.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.780
The Tenshi got in our way.

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:13.480
The Tenshi?

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:15.960
You're not very lucky.

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:16.400
Hey.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:20.020
What are you laughing for?

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:23.480
What did you accomplish, huh?

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:25.360
Uh...

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:30.090
Why are you so irritable, En-san?

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.890
It's because he failed to kill Rikukin.

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:37.230
Yeah, that's right. I was so close, too.

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:56.780
What have I done?

00:16:57.900 --> 00:16:59.100
With my own hands...

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:01.640
I...

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.820
Don't think so highly of yourself.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:09.240
Huh?

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:13.200
You can't kill me.

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:16.090
Don't scare me like that!

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.290
If you're alive, you should've said so!

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:20.550
You're the one who scared me.

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:25.670
What's a man over a hundred years 
old doing crying like a child?

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:31.000
You don't know your own strength.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:36.570
It wasn't easy protecting myself with my 
Kinkouju while bringing you to your senses.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:42.980
I focused my kinkou on protecting 
my organs and blood vessels.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.810
You broke a few bones, though.

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:52.430
Now, how will you repay me?

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.620
<i>I'm not like normal humans.</i>

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.000
<i>I'm a pervert.</i>

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:05.550
<i>When their lives are threatened, 
people kill each other.</i>

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:09.970
<i>But I kill because I enjoy it.</i>

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:13.520
Please spare me!

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:17.430
I just followed the others!

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:20.280
I don't know anything about Zensei!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.770
Please don't kill me!

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:26.100
<i>I'm a lucky pervert.</i>

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:29.680
<i>My work is my hobby.</i>

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:32.410
<i>I have a perfect life.</i>

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:34.550
Ryuuman.

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:37.440
You're in the database.

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:39.530
You're a member of Zensei.

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:42.610
There are even records of 
your subversive activity.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.960
You deserve to die.

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:54.600
Though some people deserve to die,

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.140
murder still isn't allowed.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.590
That's why I have to kill 
them as part of my job.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:10.200
Seeing these Zensei members 
makes me jealous.

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:13.360
If I hadn't met you,

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:16.730
I might have joined them.

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:22.310
Should we be here, though?

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.100
Isn't Jo Yon handling this?

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.630
I've known him a long time.

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.340
He won't mind.

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:35.310
Besides, this is my jurisdiction.

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:40.360
Anyway, you should watch yourself.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:46.910
The Express Delivery HQ has begun 
secretly investigating our part-timers.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.900
Chou Soran!

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:53.370
Chou Soran, Chou Soran, Chou Soran, Chou 
Soran, Chou Soran, Chou Soran, Chou Soran.

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:53.370
Who...

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:58.340
Chou Soran, Chou Soran, Chou Soran, 
Chou Soran, Chou Soran, Chou Soran.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.610
Chou Soran!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:01.540
That was Fuu Houhou, wasn't it?

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:05.960
Yeah. She's one of us, 
and Chou Soran's bodyguard.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.690
I heard she was strong, but...

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:14.820
She might be a part-timer like you.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:15.970
Really?

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:18.490
Chou Soran, Chou Soran, 
Chou Soran, Chou Soran.

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:21.080
Chou Soran, Chou Soran, Chou 
Soran, Chou Soran, Chou Soran,

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.070
<b>Recent Calls
Chou Soran
Chou Soran
Chou Soran
Chou Soran</b>

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:25.820
<b>Chou Soran
Calling...</b>

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:23.700
Chou Soran, Chou Soran, 
Chou Soran, Chou Soran.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.440
<i>Hello, Hou-nee?</i>

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:27.650
Are you okay?

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:29.520
Huh? What was that?

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:31.160
I can't hear you.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.290
The signal's not very good.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:37.900
Hou-nee, let's meet at the temple 
on the front of the mountain.

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:50.510
Grandfather...

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:51.700
Are you all right, Rinron?

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:53.110
Are you hurt?

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:55.610
Hou-nee, I'm glad you're okay.

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:57.270
Where have you bee—

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:58.620
Well done, Soran!

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:02.320
I owe you a huge favor!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.820
I'll give you whatever you want!

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.840
Except for Rinron, that is!

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:09.900
Uh, well...

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:25.030
I'll tell you all about what happened 
with the Tenshi when we get home.

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:27.680
Houhou, you're all right.

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:31.030
Jo San. Are you guys okay?

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:33.200
Yeah. Things have finally settled down.

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:36.200
Jo Yon is wrapping things up right—

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:35.690
No!

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:45.660
No...

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:00.080
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:03.920
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:08.010
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious</i>

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:11.930
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:16.060
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:20.150
<i>Cute, cute girl</i>

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:24.020
<i>She has such a calm face</i>

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:27.950
<i>But with her giant shovel, 
she goes from one hill to the next</i>

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:31.530
<i>And fills them with holes</i>

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>I don’t know where she came from</i>

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:39.630
<i>But if you make her mad, she’ll punch you</i>

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:43.750
<i>She’s always in a daze, 
but she’s terrifying</i>

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:47.550
<i>She’ll smack you without 
warning if you’re stupid</i>

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:51.680
<i>Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn’t shine</i>

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>This dignified girl is never scared</i>

00:22:55.890 --> 00:22:59.730
<i>She works hard all night burying</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.900
<i>She buries others in order to survive</i>

00:23:04.270 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:12.030
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.910
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious</i>

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:20.000
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers</i>

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:22.750
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t have red peppers...</i>

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:25.090
<i>I don’t, I don’t, I don’t!</i>

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:27.170
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:26.220 --> 00:23:27.180
No way!

00:23:27.180 --> 00:23:29.730
The guy who fought by puking up strange stuff

00:23:29.730 --> 00:23:32.990
and the kid who picked a fight 
with Hou-nee met a tragic end!

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:34.390
Shoushou and Mare!

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:35.840
They have names, you know!

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:38.360
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita - 
The Outcast</i>, "Master."

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>22:                Master</b>

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:39.580
Don't miss it.
